  "solution": "Gọi chiều cao mực nước trong hồ là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vì mặt phẳng nước trong bồn, mặt đáy và nắp bồn tạo thành ba mặt phẳng song song nên theo Thales\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>",
